<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107143" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπένερθε</span></b> , also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπεν-θεν</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>underneath,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωστὴρ . . , ἠδ᾽ ὑ. ζῶμά τε καὶ μίτρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.186
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφυρὰ κάλ᾽ ὑ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				147
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				17.386
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. δὲ γαῖα φάνεσκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.242
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιτῶνά γ᾽ ἔχων . . ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					1067
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰν ὀροφὰν τὰν ὑπένερθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					42(1).102.46
				</span></i>
			 (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰν
				ὕλαν τὰν ὑπένερθεν</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				51
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>under the earth, in the nether world,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.278
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				20.61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ὑ.,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ οὐράνιοι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				371b
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.259
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. gen.
			(which sts. goes before, sts. after), <i>under, beneath,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδῶν ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.150
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. Χίοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.172
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. γενείου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					418
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαίας ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					10.87
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὐμφαλοῦ ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					977
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀγρυλῆς ὑ.</span> prob.
			in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.398.16
			</span></i>.</div>
